---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '@/components/layout/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { business, disclosures } from '@/data/business';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Transport Disclaimer"
  description="How enquiries, quotes and movements work with MMM Trailer Service, and what this website does and does not promise."
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Terms', href: '/terms/' }]} />
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">
      <h1>Terms and disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="legal__intro">
        Plain terms covering what this website is for and what an enquiry does and does
        not commit either of us to.
      </p>

      <h2>Enquiries are not bookings</h2>
      <p>{disclosures.shipper}</p>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website is an offer capable of acceptance. A movement is agreed
        when we have confirmed it with you directly.
      </p>

      <h2>For truck owners</h2>
      <p>{disclosures.truckOwner}</p>

      <h2>Our own trailers and our transport network</h2>
      <p>
        We operate our own 40 ft trailers, and we also coordinate movements using trucks
        belonging to owners we work with. Where a movement is carried on a vehicle that
        is not ours, we will tell you so. We do not present other operators' vehicles as
        our own.
      </p>

      <h2>Quotes</h2>
      <p>
        Quotes are given per movement on the basis of the information you provide. If
        the cargo, dimensions, weight, loading arrangements or dates turn out to differ
        from what was described, the quote may change. Charges such as waiting time,
        tolls, permits and escorts depend on the job and we will tell you where they
        apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Transit times</h2>
      <p>
        Any transit time we give is an estimate. Road conditions, loading delays,
        permits and checks are outside our control, and we do not guarantee delivery
        times.
      </p>

      <h2>Insurance and liability</h2>
      <p>
        Insurance cover for a consignment is agreed per movement. Please raise it with
        us before loading if cover matters for your cargo — do not assume it from
        anything on this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Permits and documentation</h2>
      <p>
        Consignment documentation, including e-way bills where they apply, is normally
        raised by the consignor. We will tell you what the driver needs to carry. For
        over-dimensional movements we will advise what permissions are required.
      </p>

      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the information here accurate and up to date as far as we reasonably
        can. Photographs show our own vehicles on real jobs and are published as taken.
        Specifications and capabilities should be confirmed with us for your particular
        load rather than assumed from a page.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {business.name}, proprietor {business.owner}. Questions about these terms:{' '}
        {business.email}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .legal__intro {
    margin-block: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-6);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    color: var(--ink-600);
  }

  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: var(--sp-7);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
  }

  .legal p {
    margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    color: var(--ink-600);
  }
</style>
